AboutText=Rookparcel {version}\n\nPonovna izrada µTorrenta 2.2.1, izgrađena na prijenosu libtorrent-rasterbara 2.0.11 u Rust.\n\nCopyright 2026 DukeCorp1996. Besplatno za nekomercijalnu upotrebu pod licencom PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.\n\nPreneseni kod libtorrenta: Copyright (c) 2003-2020, Arvid Norberg and contributors, BSD-3-Clause. Tekstovi licenci: LICENSE.md, THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, ili pokrenite rookparcel-nox --license.\n\nNije povezano s libtorrent, qBittorrent, µTorrent ni BitTorrent, Inc.\n\nPostavke: {path}
